{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/dragon-blooded/1210734-other-dragon-blooded-charms-you-d-like-to-see","id":1210734,"title":"Other Dragon-Blooded Charms you'd like to see","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","Exalted","Dragon-Blooded"],"posts":[{"date":"2018-04-23T18:39:26-07:00","id":1210734,"title":"Other Dragon-Blooded Charms you'd like to see","content":"I wonder if there's place in Awareness for night vision and thermal vision as a Fire-aspected Charm? Maybe also allow it to protect against blinding light, so Dragon-Blooded have an answer to their own Blinding Spark Distraction.<br /> <br /> I feel there's room in Brawl for sand-bending Charms similar to the water-bending ones, so that you can get your &quot;Gaara of the Desert&quot; on. Robert Vance didn't seem to think it was as simple as upgrade Charms that let you use the water-ones with sand and Earth Aura.<br /> <br /> Elemental Sheath for Archery. Probably do something very different for Dragon-Graced &quot;Arrow&quot;, or just no equivalent for Dragon-Graced Weapon at all.<br /> <br /> Maybe Dragon-Graced Armor, following Elemental Aegis?<br /> <br /> An Occult 5, Essence 5 Charm following Puissant Dragon Sorceror, if Dragon-Blooded really can't have access to the other rituals of their initiations. Your second Occult Signature Charm is not a substitute!<br /> <br /> A Medicine Charm following Deft Poisoner's Way that allows you to channel poisons in your body out through your attacks and into your enemies.<br /> <br /> <br /> And I'd really like to see an Earth-Bender's ability to raise a stone wall from the ground with a stomp, to create cover or use as a platform to reach a higher range band. Not sure which Ability this would be; I could see it as an Earth Dragon Style Charm, but I doubt they'll add it to that Style.<br /> <br /> Ramparts of the Obedient Earth is now strictly a strategic warfare time-scale effect, rather than an instant rearrangement of the battlefield.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>formerly Tornado Wolf, formerly Inugami","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/636-sunder-the-gold","name":"Sunder the Gold","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar636_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"5515"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-04-23T19:06:14-07:00","id":1210742,"title":"","content":"* An Air (and possibly Wood) Charm that to aid with normal close combat dodging (this might be covered by Air Dragon Style, we'll see). As it stands it's extra difficult to maintain Air Aura in combat, and using Safety Among Enemies requires you successfully dodge which RAW you can currently only use the excellency to help you do and maintain Aura. If it's an Air and Wood Charm, call it &quot;Leaf on the Wind&quot; or &quot;Be the Leaf&quot;.<br /> <br /> Worth noting the most well known Air Elementalist in citable in inspiration media here is a dodge-monkey... but he's also a Martial Artist Monk, so again, Air Dragon Style might cover it.<br /> <br /> *Bolin style Lava-Bending<br /> <br /> *Something to enhance their relationship with wild elementals. Useless on elementals bound to others, but something to let them evoke the authority of the appropriate Dragon to cow an elemental of equal of lesser essence than themselves. A higher essence upgrade to this Charm could even let them tame an existent elemental as their familiar.<br /> <br /> * An Earth Sail Charm that calls up rocks to impede other ships<br /> <br /> *Perhaps a Medicine Charm that lets you form a prosthetic limb from your Aspect Element, that you can also reshape for temporary physical mutation advantages (think Ming-Hua, though works as well with a vine limb.... Earth would need alternate advantage of being stronger but without the reshaping ease... fire and air are harder to conceive of).","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Check out my expansion to the <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/185084-autochthonia-house-material\" target=\"_blank\">Realm of Brass and Shadow</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1098-glamourweaver","name":"glamourweaver","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1098_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"7541"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-08-13T18:06:12-07:00","id":1245697,"title":"","content":"Following Rolling Boulder Blow, a Fire or &quot;Fire/Earth&quot; aspected Charm (Volcanic Uppercut Fist) that uses a smashing Brawl attack to knock you target straight up, potentially smashing against a ceiling, and certainly taking damage from the fall back down. They're left prone, and still within your range band for further attacks.<br /> <br /> This gives the Terrestrial Brawler more versatility, not only in a new trick, but also as a way for non-Fire Aspect brawlers to enter Fire Aura and use Erupting Fury Barrage.<br /> <br /> Plus, it's the Dragon Punch. How can you leave the Dragon-Blooded without a Dragon Punch?","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>formerly Tornado Wolf, formerly Inugami","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/636-sunder-the-gold","name":"Sunder the Gold","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar636_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"5515"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-08-13T22:15:49-07:00","id":1245760,"title":"","content":"What about cooperative charms that enable celestial circle sorcery?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12952-accelerator","name":"Accelerator","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2017"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3232"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-08-13T22:41:33-07:00","id":1245766,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Accelerator</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/dragon-blooded/1210734-other-dragon-blooded-charms-you-d-like-to-see?p=1245760#post1245760\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">What about cooperative charms that enable celestial circle sorcery?</div> </div> </div> </div>While i\u2019m all in favor of more cooperative charms for DBs, I think giving the Realm access to Celestial Circle Sorcery outside the singular person of the Empress (and she\u2019s gone!)would have too great setting ramifications to introduce via a Charm like that.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Check out my expansion to the <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/185084-autochthonia-house-material\" target=\"_blank\">Realm of Brass and Shadow</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":3}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1098-glamourweaver","name":"glamourweaver","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1098_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"7541"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-08-14T01:48:53-07:00","id":1245794,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>glamourweaver</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/dragon-blooded/1210734-other-dragon-blooded-charms-you-d-like-to-see?p=1245766#post1245766\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> While i\u2019m all in favor of more cooperative charms for DBs, I think giving the Realm access to Celestial Circle Sorcery outside the singular person of the Empress (and she\u2019s gone!)would have too great setting ramifications to introduce via a Charm like that.</div> </div> </div> </div>There's still Minemon. She can cast Summon Second Circle Demon through the Emerald Thurible, and Mara knows Celestial Circle Sorcery.<br /> <br /> But still, there's one DB in all of Creation that can pull it off, with preparation and hoop-jumping.<br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/24387-amayad","name":"Amayad","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jul 2018"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"137"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}